{"traceId":"hw-personalization-proof:decision:r4","eventType":"theory_decision","evidenceRead":["negative-uncertain:baseline:rating"],"theoryUsed":"personalization-proof-theory","changeSummary":"baseline_evaluating -> baseline_evaluating","reason":"The finalized session packet was claimed for one Planner decision.","writesTo":["/Users/jamaltaylor/Development/sunny-demo-main/outputs/math-personalization-live/2026-08-08T13-43-30/personalization/negative-uncertain/isolated-context/src/context/personalization-proof-child/homework/cycles/hw-personalization-proof.json"],"createdAt":"2026-08-08T19:10:33.594Z"}
{"traceId":"hw-personalization-proof:decision:r5","eventType":"theory_decision","evidenceRead":["shared-baseline-session:baseline:completion","shared-baseline-session:baseline:completion:engagement","negative-uncertain:baseline:rating"],"theoryUsed":"personalization-proof-theory","changeSummary":"baseline_evaluating -> quest_generating","reason":"All three baseline items were unassisted and correct (accuracy 1.00, above the preregistered 0.70–1.00 band), but every observation is tagged exposure=previously_practiced and provenance=practice. Practice performance can justify a transfer test; it cannot confirm the transfer hypothesis, and the predicted error pattern (factor-pair overgeneralization) was never put at risk because no item required reinterpreting a novel structure. Engagement is the sharper signal: 142s, no replay, confusion and hesitation flags, and a fun rating of 1/5 alongside perfect accuracy — the child was correct and unmoved, which means the instrument told us nothing about how far the reasoning stretches. Quest eligibility is open on independent-correct evidence, so the right move is an unseen-transfer Quest that forces equal-groups reasoning into an unfamiliar shape with real cost attached.","writesTo":["/Users/jamaltaylor/Development/sunny-demo-main/outputs/math-personalization-live/2026-08-08T13-43-30/personalization/negative-uncertain/isolated-context/src/context/personalization-proof-child/homework/cycles/hw-personalization-proof.json"],"createdAt":"2026-08-08T19:10:33.598Z"}
